          <input type="text" id="national_id" placeholder="" maxlength="10">
          <svg class="input-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="field-error" id="err-national_id" >@SharedLocalizer["reg_errRequired"]</span>
        <span class="field-error" id="val-national_id" >@SharedLocalizer["reg_valNationalId"]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label >@SharedLocalizer["reg_lblPhone"]</label>
        <div class="phone-wrap" id="phoneWrap">
          <span class="cc">+966</span>
          @* من غير maxlength: المتصفح بيقص اللصق قبل التنظيف، فلصق 0501234567
             كان بيضيّع رقم. الحد في normalizeSaMobile بعد التنظيف. *@
          <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder='@(SharedLocalizer["reg_phPhone"].Value)'
